{"m_open": "<div class=\"w-screen\"><header class=\"w-head\"><div class=\"w-head-bar\"><button class=\"w-head-btn back\" aria-label=\"Back\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"/></svg></button></div><div class=\"w-head-text\"><h1>Open your Mashreq account</h1></div></header><div class=\"w-screen-body\"><div class=\"w-steps\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i></div><div class=\"w-hero\"><span>Account ready</span><strong>•••• 4567</strong><small>Islamic Current Profit Account · up to 2% a year</small></div><section class=\"w-rowgroup\"><h4>What Mashreq checked, in about five minutes</h4><div class=\"w-rowgroup-body\"><div class=\"w-row\"><span class=\"w-row-icon ok\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M16 10h2\"/><path d=\"M16 14h2\"/><path d=\"M6.17 15a3 3 0 0 1 5.66 0\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"11\" r=\"2\"/><rect x=\"2\" y=\"5\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/></svg></span><span class=\"w-row-text\"><b>CNIC</b><small>Front and back scanned</small></span><span class=\"w-row-val ok\"><b>Done</b></span></div><div class=\"w-row\"><span class=\"w-row-icon ok\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 10a2 2 0 0 0-2 2c0 1.02-.1 2.51-.26 4\"/><path d=\"M14 13.12c0 2.38 0 6.38-1 8.88\"/><path d=\"M17.29 21.02c.12-.6.43-2.3.5-3.02\"/><path d=\"M2 12a10 10 0 0 1 18-6\"/><path d=\"M2 16h.01\"/><path d=\"M21.8 16c.2-2 .131-5.354 0-6\"/><path d=\"M5 19.5C5.5 18 6 15 6 12a6 6 0 0 1 .34-2\"/><path d=\"M8.65 22c.21-.66.45-1.32.57-2\"/><path d=\"M9 6.8a6 6 0 0 1 9 5.2v2\"/></svg></span><span class=\"w-row-text\"><b>NADRA biometric</b><small>Verified against your CNIC</small></span><span class=\"w-row-val ok\"><b>Done</b></span></div><div class=\"w-row\"><span class=\"w-row-icon ok\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"/><path d=\"M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2\"/><path d=\"M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"/><path d=\"M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2\"/><path d=\"M8 14s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2\"/><path d=\"M9 9h.01\"/><path d=\"M15 9h.01\"/></svg></span><span class=\"w-row-text\"><b>Live face</b><small>Matched to your CNIC photo</small></span><span class=\"w-row-val ok\"><b>Done</b></span></div><div class=\"w-row\"><span class=\"w-row-icon ok\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M16 20V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16\"/><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"6\" rx=\"2\"/></svg></span><span class=\"w-row-text\"><b>Customer due diligence</b><small>Occupation and source of income</small></span><span class=\"w-row-val ok\"><b>Done</b></span></div></div></section><div class=\"w-inset\"><div class=\"w-notice info\"><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"/><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"/></svg></span><p>Halqa never holds your money. Instalments and pots move inside your Mashreq account.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"w-bottom\"><button class=\"primary full\">Continue to the circle</button></div></div>", "m_mandate": "<div class=\"w-screen\"><header class=\"w-head\"><div class=\"w-head-bar\"><button class=\"w-head-btn back\" aria-label=\"Back\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"/></svg></button></div><div class=\"w-head-text\"><h1>Automatic payment</h1></div></header><div class=\"w-screen-body\"><div class=\"w-hero\"><span>Direct debit mandate</span><strong>Rs&nbsp;10,000</strong><small>Clifton Savers · every month</small></div><section class=\"w-rowgroup\"><h4>What you allow</h4><div class=\"w-rowgroup-body\"><div class=\"w-row\"><span class=\"w-row-icon ok\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 18v-7\"/><path d=\"M11.119 2.205a2 2 0 0 1 1.762 0l7.84 3.846A.5.5 0 0 1 20.5 7h-17a.5.5 0 0 1-.22-.949z\"/><path d=\"M14 18v-7\"/><path d=\"M18 18v-7\"/><path d=\"M3 22h18\"/><path d=\"M6 18v-7\"/></svg></span><span class=\"w-row-text\"><b>From your Mashreq account</b><small>•••• 4567</small></span><span class=\"w-row-val ok\"><b>Default</b></span></div><div class=\"w-row\"><span class=\"w-row-icon \"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></span><span class=\"w-row-text\"><b>Most each time</b><small>One instalment, never more</small></span><span class=\"w-row-val \"><b>Rs&nbsp;10,000</b></span></div><div class=\"w-row\"><span class=\"w-row-icon \"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M16 14v2.2l1.6 1\"/><path d=\"M16 2v4\"/><path d=\"M21 7.5V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h3.5\"/><path d=\"M3 10h5\"/><path d=\"M8 2v4\"/><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"16\" r=\"6\"/></svg></span><span class=\"w-row-text\"><b>When</b><small>On your payday, the 1st</small></span><span class=\"w-row-val \"><b>1st</b></span></div><div class=\"w-row\"><span class=\"w-row-icon \"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m17 2 4 4-4 4\"/><path d=\"M3 11v-1a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h14\"/><path d=\"m7 22-4-4 4-4\"/><path d=\"M21 13v1a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H3\"/></svg></span><span class=\"w-row-text\"><b>If your salary is late</b><small>A retry each morning, five at most</small></span><span class=\"w-row-val \"><b>Until the 8th</b></span></div></div></section><section class=\"w-rowgroup\"><h4>Other ways to pay</h4><div class=\"w-rowgroup-body\"><button class=\"w-row\"><span class=\"w-row-icon \"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"w-row-text\"><b>One-tap approval</b><small>A card, wallet or Raast request you approve</small></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></button><button class=\"w-row\"><span class=\"w-row-icon \"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M11 15h2a2 2 0 1 0 0-4h-3c-.6 0-1.1.2-1.4.6L3 17\"/><path d=\"m7 21 1.6-1.4c.3-.4.8-.6 1.4-.6h4c1.1 0 2.1-.4 2.8-1.2l4.6-4.4a2 2 0 0 0-2.75-2.91l-4.2 3.9\"/><path d=\"m2 16 6 6\"/><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2.9\"/><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"5\" r=\"3\"/></svg></span><span class=\"w-row-text\"><b>Pay it yourself</b><small>From any bank account or wallet</small></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></button></div></section><div class=\"w-inset\"><div class=\"w-notice info\"><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"/><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"/></svg></span><p>Cancel the mandate at any time. Your place in the circle stays and you pay by one-tap approval instead.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"w-bottom\"><button class=\"primary full\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg> Give consent</button></div></div>", "m_methods": "<div class=\"w-screen\"><header class=\"w-head\"><div class=\"w-head-bar\"><button class=\"w-head-btn back\" aria-label=\"Back\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"r