/><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"/></svg></span><span class=\"w-row-text\"><b>JazzCash wallet</b><small>Linked through a licensed PSP</small></span><span class=\"w-row-val ok\"><b>Linked</b></span></div><div class=\"w-row\"><span class=\"w-row-icon ok\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"20\" x=\"5\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"/></svg></span><span class=\"w-row-text\"><b>Easypaisa wallet</b><small>Linked through a licensed PSP</small></span><span class=\"w-row-val ok\"><b>Linked</b></span></div><div class=\"w-row\"><span class=\"w-row-icon ok\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"5\" rx=\"2\"/><line x1=\"2\" x2=\"22\" y1=\"10\" y2=\"10\"/></svg></span><span class=\"w-row-text\"><b>Debit card</b><small>•••• 4419 · saved with the PSP</small></span><span class=\"w-row-val ok\"><b>Linked</b></span></div></div></section><section class=\"w-rowgroup\"><h4>How it works</h4><div class=\"w-rowgroup-body\"><div class=\"w-row\"><span class=\"w-row-icon \"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z\"/><circle cx=\"16.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></span><span class=\"w-row-text\"><b>The PSP keeps the token</b><small>Halqa keeps only a reference, never a card number</small></span></div><div class=\"w-row\"><span class=\"w-row-icon \"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 17V3\"/><path d=\"m6 11 6 6 6-6\"/><path d=\"M19 21H5\"/></svg></span><span class=\"w-row-text\"><b>Money settles at Mashreq</b><small>Into the committee account, never to Halqa</small></span></div></div></section></div><div class=\"w-bottom\"><button class=\"primary full\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"M12 5v14\"/></svg> Add a wallet or card</button></div></div>", "m_types": "<div class=\"w-screen\"><header class=\"w-head\"><div class=\"w-head-bar\"><button class=\"w-head-btn back\" aria-label=\"Back\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"/></svg></button></div><div class=\"w-head-text\"><h1>Start a committee</h1></div></header><div class=\"w-screen-body\"><div class=\"w-steps\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"\"></i><i class=\"\"></i></div><div class=\"w-title\"><h2>What kind of circle?</h2><p>The less the members know each other, the more checks apply.</p></div><section class=\"w-rowgroup\"><h4>Committee types</h4><div class=\"w-rowgroup-body\"><button class=\"w-row\"><span class=\"w-row-icon \"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"/><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/></